    "own_line": true,
    "norm": "Builds an XML document with {@code encoding} in the prolog, writes it through an {@link XmlStreamWriter} configured with {@code defaultEncoding}, and delegates to {@link #checkXmlContent} for assertions. <p>When {@code encoding} is {@code null} the writer falls back to {@code defaultEncoding}, or UTF-8 if that is also {@code null}.</p>"
   },
